<title>USA: Call Now to buy back $500,000 of stock.</title>
<headline>Call Now to buy back $500,000 of stock.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI SHORES, Fla. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Call Now Inc said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to $500,000 worth of common stock.</p>
<p>It said it had about 7.5 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>On April 10 the stock closed at 3-1/8.</p>
</text>
